// HeatedDuct: single-stream eps-NTU pickup from a 450 K wall node
// (eps = 1 - exp(-UA/(mdot*cp)) ~ 0.52 at UA = 150, mdot = 0.2 of Air).
// The wall port shares stream wl with the ThermalSource positionally.
