// frees-language: 2
// CabinZone pulldown (the component's natural transient): a 3 m3 cabin
// starting warm and humid (27 C, W = 0.010) is ventilated with 0.12 kg/s of
// cool supply air (15 C, W = 0.007) against two occupants (70 W sensible,
